//* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *         
//W41848  EXEC PGM=SORT                                                         
//SORTIN   DD  DSN=&INDIN..W41849(+0),DISP=SHR                                  
//**************   LISTPOSTER                                       ***         
//*                                                                             
//SORTOUT  DD  DSN=&&W41848,DISP=(NEW,PASS,DELETE),                             
//**************   SORTERADE LISTPOSTER                             ***         
